{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33358","headline":"白马 · 翁绶","name":"白马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渥洼龙种雪霜同，毛骨天生胆气雄。\n金埒乍调光照地，玉关初别远嘶风。\n花明锦襜垂杨下，露湿朱缨细草中。\n一夜羽书催转战，紫髯骑出佩騂弓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁绶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}